<rml>
<head>
  <title>Prime Studio</title>
  <link type="text/template" href="../../components/app-shell.rml"/>
  <link type="text/rcss" href="../../components/controls.rcss"/>
  <link type="text/rcss" href="native-entry.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="prime-shell">
  <div id="native_studio_entry">
    <div id="native_studio_chooser">
      <div class="eyebrow">PROJECT PRIME // CREATION</div>
      <h1>PRIME STUDIO</h1>
      <p>Review recordings, direct cameras, or create a custom weapon in the separate Studio app.</p>
      <button id="native_studio_weapon" data-action="studio:weapon-new">OPEN WEAPON CREATOR</button>
      <div class="studio-destinations">
        <div class="studio-destination studio-technical">
          <div class="studio-card-art replay-art"><div class="replay-frame"></div><div class="replay-play"></div><div class="replay-track replay-track-a"></div><div class="replay-track replay-track-b"></div><div class="replay-playhead"></div></div>
          <div class="studio-card-copy"><div class="eyebrow">REVIEW // EDIT // EXPORT</div><h2>REPLAY STUDIO</h2>
          <p>Browse recordings and clips, edit the timeline, and direct your camera.</p>
          <button id="native_studio_theatre" data-action="studio:pick-map">OPEN REPLAY STUDIO</button><button id="native_studio_replay_open" style="display:none" data-action="route:theatre">OPEN REPLAY STUDIO</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="studio-destination studio-forge">
          <div class="studio-card-art forge-art"><div class="forge-grid"></div><div class="forge-platform"></div><div class="forge-block forge-block-a"></div><div class="forge-block forge-block-b"></div></div>
          <div class="studio-card-copy"><div class="eyebrow">FUTURE WORKSPACE</div><h2>MAP STUDIO</h2>
          <p>Coming soon. Map authoring is not available yet; this opens the separate app’s workspace placeholder.</p>
          <button id="native_studio_map" data-action="studio:launch">OPEN MAP STUDIO</button></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="studio-entry-footer"><p id="native_studio_status" role="status"/><button id="native_studio_chooser_back" data-action="studio:cancel">BACK TO HOME</button></div>
  </div>
</body></rml>
